<Base title="Pikobuy Forwarding Guide | Warehouse Address, Inspection & Parcel" description="Use Pikobuy forwarding when you already placed the original order. Prepare warehouse receiving details, check the photos and submit a parcel.">
  <PageHead title="How Pikobuy forwarding works" copy="Use this workflow when you buy from a seller yourself and send the goods to the Pikobuy warehouse."/>
  <section class="container section reading">
    <article>
      <h2>Decide who places the seller order</h2>
      <p>Use the buying guide if you want Pikobuy to purchase the Weidian item for you. For forwarding, you complete the seller order yourself and arrange for the sender to deliver it to Pikobuy’s warehouse.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/how-to-buy/">Read the purchasing-agent workflow</a></p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Get the warehouse instructions and submit the form</h2>
      <p>Get the current warehouse address from the forwarding form or Pikobuy support. Copy the recipient and receiving details exactly. Submit Pikobuy’s forwarding form, and keep the sender’s parcel reference, domestic tracking number and an item list to help identify the shipment.</p>
      <p>Check whether the sender prepaid domestic delivery. If the parcel arrives with domestic postage due, Pikobuy’s terms say it can deduct that charge from your account balance. <a class="text-link" href="https://www.pikobuy.com/protocol/shipping" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Read the official forwarding terms</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Match the warehouse record to what the sender shipped</h2>
      <p>Compare the arrival record and available photos with your item list. If a piece is missing, verify the sender’s packing and tracking details. Ask Pikobuy about the available inspection options for your item, especially if it requires a functional or specialist check.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/qc/#qc-checklist">Use the warehouse photo checklist</a></p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Handle seller issues before international dispatch</h2>
      <p>Contact the original seller or sender for after-sales help on a forwarded purchase. Pikobuy’s forwarding terms explain that it can help return the shipment to the seller or sender. Keep photos and both order references together while the issue is open.</p>
      <p>Once the items are ready, submit the international parcel using the actual contents, destination, packed weight and dimensions. <a class="text-link" href="/guides/shipping/">Compare parcel routes and fees</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
